WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.003
FedRAMP standardizes cloud security assessment, authorization,

00:00:03.003 --> 00:00:07.842
and continuous monitoring for cloud services used by federal agencies.

00:00:07.842 --> 00:00:14.132
The program is built on NIST guidance, especially NIST SP 800-53 security controls.

00:00:14.132 --> 00:00:19.455
FedRAMP supports secure cloud adoption by improving consistency, reuse of evidence,

00:00:19.455 --> 00:00:21.874
risk visibility, and ongoing monitoring.

00:00:21.874 --> 00:00:26.713
Strong FedRAMP programs depend on governance, technical controls, documentation, assessment,

00:00:26.713 --> 00:00:30.100
continuous monitoring, shared responsibility, and continuous improvement.
